        "content": "{\"topics\":[{\"topic_name\":\"Handling business addresses versus private addresses in safety labeling\",\"member_ids\":[\"M01\",\"M02\"],\"shared_issue\":{\"text\":\"Members asked how to handle addresses associated with named businesses, specifically whether news-article or official business-page context makes the address public contact information rather than private address information requiring stricter handling.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"E001\",\"E004\",\"E005\"]},\"relevant_differences\":[{\"text\":\"In the news-article case, the reply distinguishes the reviewed business office address from an individual's location and says a personal location would need separate PII review.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"E001\",\"E003\"]},{\"text\":\"In the official-business-page case, the reply treats the listing as a public business contact channel and adds an escalation condition only if private identifying details also appear.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"E004\",\"E005\"]}],\"inventory\":[{\"item_id\":\"I01\",\"evidence_id\":\"E001\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"answer_status\":null,\"question\":{\"status\":\"ANSWERED\",\"answer_item_ids\":[\"I03\"],\"resolution_confidence\":0.77,\"uncertainty_note\":{\"text\":\"The question is phrased broadly about news articles, while the direct reply is scoped to the reviewed article and contrasts business versus personal locations.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"E001\",\"E003\"]}}},{\"item_id\":\"I02\",\"evidence_id\":\"E002\",\"kind\":\"ANSWER\",\"answer_status\":\"TENTATIVE\",\"question\":null},{\"item_id\":\"I03\",\"evidence_id\":\"E003\",\"kind\":\"ANSWER\",\"answer_status\":\"DIRECT\",\"question\":null},{\"item_id\":\"I04\",\"evidence_id\":\"E004\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"answer_status\":null,\"question\":{\"status\":\"ANSWERED\",\"answer_item_ids\":[\"I05\"],\"resolution_confidence\":0.86,\"uncertainty_note\":{\"text\":\"The reply does not literally say 'do not quarantine' but treats the official business listing as a public contact channel f